        <a class="project-card accent-green" href="https://github.com/kpnss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <h3>Kalman Filtering for SoC Estimation</h3>
          <p>Thesis project — Simulink environment and tuned Kalman Filter for battery state-of-charge estimation.</p>
          <span class="tags">Matlab · Simulink · Control Theory</span>
        </a>
        <a class="project-card accent-blue" href="https://github.com/kpnss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <h3>Monocular SLAM</h3>
          <p>Differential-drive localization and SLAM using a single camera.</p>
          <span class="tags">Matlab (Octave) · SLAM</span>
        </a>
        <a class="project-card accent-green" href="https://github.com/kpnss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <h3>Humanoid Robot Balance Control</h3>
          <p>ZMP-based balance control for a humanoid robot using Model Predictive Control.</p>
          <span class="tags">Python · MPC · Optimization</span>
        </a>
        <a class="project-card accent-blue" href="https://github.com/kpnss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <h3>CBF Shared Control for Quadrotors</h3>
          <p>Shared control simulation for a quadrotor using Control Barrier Functions.</p>
          <span class="tags">Matlab · Shared Control</span>
        </a>
        <a class="project-card accent-green" href="https://github.com/kpnss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <h3>Ground to Aerial Image Matching</h3>
          <p>Synthetic satellite image generation and joint feature learning for ground-to-satellite matching.</p>
          <span class="tags">PyTorch · Stable Diffusion · VGG</span>
        </a>
        <a class="project-card accent-blue" href="https://github.com/kpnss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <h3>Telegram News Bot</h3>
          <p>Telegram bot with automatic RSS parsing, SQLite tracking, and Docker/GitHub Actions automation.</p>
          <span class="tags">Python · SQLite · Docker</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="projects-note">↳ You can access the source code for each (public) project by clicking on the links above.</p>
